  "body": "# Announcement\r\n\r\n> [!IMPORTANT]\r\n> Fixes a security vulnerability, as described in [GHSA-9x8v-5f43-c55r](https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-java/security/advisories/GHSA-9x8v-5f43-c55r).\r\n\r\n# Components\r\n\r\n## Tracer core\r\n\r\n* :sparkles: Update default query string obfuscation pattern (#12784 - @jandro996)\r\n\r\n# Instrumentations\r\n\r\n## Core Java language instrumentation\r\n\r\n* :bug: Fix startup deadlock with virtual threads (#12788 - @amarziali)\r\n",
